# Copy to .env.local for local dev. Both are optional: without them the
# view/search counters simply stay at 0 instead of erroring out.
#
# Free tier: create a Redis database at https://console.upstash.com
# (or via the Vercel Marketplace "Upstash" integration on your Vercel
# project) and paste the REST credentials it gives you below.
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# Optional: without this, per-video stats (views/likes/comments/shares) will
# fail on most cloud hosting (confirmed on Vercel: TikTok returns an instant
# HTTP 403 for the crawler-flagged request from Vercel's IP ranges). Profile
# stats (followers, likes, video count) are unaffected either way.
#
# Set to a standard authenticated proxy URL from any scraping-proxy provider
# (ScraperAPI, ScrapingBee, Zenrows, Bright Data, Smartproxy, etc.) - only
# the video-stats request is routed through it. Format: a plain
# http://user:pass@host:port URL, exactly as your provider's dashboard gives
# it to you for their "proxy port" / "standard proxy" mode (not their
# custom REST API format).
TIKTOK_PROXY_URL=
